[[2047,127,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238832\">7040G36</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238703\">7015A05</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238704\">7015A06</a></p><p>1. Open protection  (1a) and disconnect the aerial lead  connection\n(1b).</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connections.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Additional (&quot;third brake light&quot;)</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236024\">F40</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Undo the spoiler retaining nuts.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019865.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,65536,"<p>1. Lower the tailgate.</p><p>2. Remove the spoiler (2a) complete with braids (2b).</p><p>If necessary, remove the third brake light\n (refer to op. \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238489\">5550D16</a>\n                                           )</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019866.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the spoiler  is undamaged.</p><p>If removed, refit the third brake light\n(see op. \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238489\">5550D16</a>\n                                           ).</p><p>Fit the spoiler and the braids.</p><p>Lift the tailgate.</p><p>Tighten the spoiler retaining nuts.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>SPOILER</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.85</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection for the\nthird brake light.</p><p>Connect the aerial lead connection and\ndo up the protection.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238704\">7015A06</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238703\">7015A05</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238832\">7040G36</a></p>"]]